Create a todo. Creates a todo on either a task or a deal — provide the `description` and one of `task_id` or `deal_id`. Optionally set `assignee_id` and `closed`.

`due_date` applies only to **deal todos**.

### Task todo
```json
{
  "data": {
    "type": "todos",
    "attributes": {
      "description": "Review the design draft",
      "task_id": 4421188,
      "assignee_id": 314
    }
  }
}
```

### Deal todo
```json
{
  "data": {
    "type": "todos",
    "attributes": {
      "description": "Follow up on contract terms",
      "deal_id": 88401,
      "assignee_id": 314,
      "due_date": "2026-06-01"
    }
  }
}
```
